    "html": "<div class=\"container py-5\">\n  <div class=\"row g-5 align-items-center\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552664730-d307ca884978?w=800&h=600&fit=crop\" alt=\"Team working together at a table\" class=\"img-fluid rounded-4 shadow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-6\"><span class=\"badge bg-primary-subtle text-primary\">Our Story</span>\n      <h2 class=\"fw-bold mt-2\">From students to a global team</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-muted\">In 2019, three university students in Dhaka wanted to make web development easier for beginners. Today, we serve tens of thousands of learners across 40+ countries with free, high-quality components and tutorials in both Bangla and English.</p><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-outline-dark\">Read the full story</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
