    "html": "<div class=\"container py-5\">\n  <div class=\"p-5 rounded-4 text-center\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);color:#fff\"><i class=\"bi bi-quote display-3 text-warning\"></i>\n    <blockquote class=\"fs-3 fw-light mb-4\">\"We started CodeShikhi because we wished this existed when we were learning. Now it does — for you.\"</blockquote><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?w=100&h=100&fit=crop\" class=\"rounded-circle mb-2\" alt=\"Founder portrait\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px;object-fit:cover\">\n    <div class=\"fw-bold\">Tanvir Ahmed</div><small class=\"text-white-50\">Founder, CodeShikhi</small>\n  </div>\n</div>",
