    "html": "<section class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"container py-4\" style=\"max-width:760px;\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-center fw-bold mb-5\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    <div class=\"accordion accordion-flush\" id=\"faqAcc\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n        <h2 class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#q1\">Is it free to use?</button></h2>\n        <div id=\"q1\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse show\" data-bs-parent=\"#faqAcc\">\n          <div class=\"accordion-body text-muted\">Yes — every component is free to copy and use.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n        <h2 class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#q2\">Do I need to know code?</button></h2>\n        <div id=\"q2\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faqAcc\">\n          <div class=\"accordion-body text-muted\">If you can copy & paste, you can use these.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n        <h2 class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#q3\">Can I use these commercially?</button></h2>\n        <div id=\"q3\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#faqAcc\">\n          <div class=\"accordion-body text-muted\">Absolutely — personal and commercial use are allowed.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
