    "html": "<div class=\"container py-5\">\n  <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\n    <h2 class=\"fw-bold\">What Our Customers Say</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-muted\">Real reviews from happy users.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row g-4\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 p-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-warning mb-2\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"mb-3\">\"Absolutely fantastic experience. The team went above and beyond.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-3\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/60?img=12\" class=\"rounded-circle\" width=\"48\" alt=\"Reviewer Sarah\">\n          <div>\n            <h6 class=\"mb-0\">Sarah K.</h6><small class=\"text-muted\">Verified buyer</small>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 p-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-warning mb-2\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"mb-3\">\"Best purchase I have made this year. Quality is unmatched.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-3\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/60?img=32\" class=\"rounded-circle\" width=\"48\" alt=\"Reviewer Michael\">\n          <div>\n            <h6 class=\"mb-0\">Michael R.</h6><small class=\"text-muted\">Verified buyer</small>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 p-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-warning mb-2\">★★★★☆</div>\n        <p class=\"mb-3\">\"Great product overall, shipping was a little slow but worth it.\"</p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-3\"><img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/60?img=47\" class=\"rounded-circle\" width=\"48\" alt=\"Reviewer Aisha\">\n          <div>\n            <h6 class=\"mb-0\">Aisha M.</h6><small class=\"text-muted\">Verified buyer</small>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
