    "html": "<div class=\"container py-5\">\n  <h3 class=\"fw-bold text-center mb-4\">A wall of love</h3>\n  <div class=\"row g-3\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-3 mb-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\">@techsam</small>\n        <p class=\"mb-1 mt-1\">Best product page builder I have used.</p>\n        <div class=\"text-warning small\">★★★★★</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\">@linaux</small>\n        <p class=\"mb-1 mt-1\">The templates saved us weeks of work.</p>\n        <div class=\"text-warning small\">★★★★★</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-3 mb-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\">@moodydev</small>\n        <p class=\"mb-1 mt-1\">Docs are clear. Support is real humans.</p>\n        <div class=\"text-warning small\">★★★★★</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-3 mb-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\">@rima.co</small>\n        <p class=\"mb-1 mt-1\">Beautiful defaults. Nothing generic.</p>\n        <div class=\"text-warning small\">★★★★☆</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-3 mb-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\">@joonhk</small>\n        <p class=\"mb-1 mt-1\">Ship faster. Look better. Yes.</p>\n        <div class=\"text-warning small\">★★★★★</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm p-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\">@arif.b</small>\n        <p class=\"mb-1 mt-1\">My team switched over in a weekend.</p>\n        <div class=\"text-warning small\">★★★★★</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
